{{define "content"}}
<section class="initialization-page">
<h1>初始化权威端</h1>
<ol class="initialization-steps">
{{range .InitializationSteps}}
<li{{if .Current}} class="current"{{else if .Done}} class="done"{{end}}>{{.Label}}</li>
{{end}}
</ol>
<div class="operation-result">
<p>安装 serve 需要管理员权限。向导不会替你提权；请在终端执行完整命令。</p>
</div>
</section>
{{end}}
